ai "Blocking TE"
about "An extra lineman who sometimes leaks out."
position TE
dials aggression 0.7 discipline 0.8 vision 0.4 patience 0.5

rules:
  when run play and before the throw -> drive block
  when ball thrown to me -> secure the catch
  when with the ball -> cut upfield; lower shoulder
  when mate has the ball -> block downfield
  otherwise -> follow assignment
